<section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">MKINITRAMFS / HOOK AUTHORING</p>
    <h1>Hooks</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        A detailed guide to writing, resolving, ordering, testing, and debugging
        mkinitramfs hooks. Hooks are POSIX shell files sourced at build time and
        again inside the initramfs.
    </p>
</section>

